  <Docs>
    <summary>
            A capability enabled on a virtual network appliance. The top-level `kind` discriminator selects the
            capability family; every kind shares the same `properties` schema (see
            VirtualNetworkApplianceCapabilityProperties). One capability of a given kind may exist per appliance.
            Please note this is the base class. The derived classes available for instantiation are: <see cref="T:Azure.Provisioning.Network.Nat64Capability" />, <see cref="T:Azure.Provisioning.Network.PLGatewayCapability" />, <see cref="T:Azure.Provisioning.Network.PLGatewayFastpathCapability" />, and <see cref="T:Azure.Provisioning.Network.PLIPForwardersCapability" />.
            </summary>
    <remarks>To be added.</remarks>
